    <div class="content-panel">
      <div class="inline-card-title">Grape variety profiles — click to explore</div>
      <div class="drinks-text-19">These 17 grapes account for the overwhelming majority of wine you'll encounter. Each has a characteristic flavour profile, typical regions, and serving temperature.</div>

